   "rendered": "<p>Mirus senoliui, liko jo ištikima keturkojė draugė Ganga… Kalytė buvo palikta viena nešildomoje troboje.&nbsp; Paimta iš Daugėlių k., sodų bendrija „Sodžius“, Šiaulių r.</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-5\" class=\"gallery galleryid-92734 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://siauliuletenele.lt/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/received_1452712079533923.jpg\"><img src=\"https://siauliuletenele.lt/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/received_1452712079533923-300x253.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://siauliuletenele.lt/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/received_1618918522865149.jpg\"><img src=\"https://siauliuletenele.lt/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/received_1618918522865149-300x265.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
